  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-08T17:29:34.186241Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T19:54:35.588649Z",
  "totalBlocks": 149,
  "translatedBlocks": 148,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c019c900f15611d",
      "translationZh": "构建一道持续集成与持续交付（CI/CD）质量门禁，部署一个使用基于角色的 MCP 工具的智能体，对其进行评估，并在评估分数下降时阻止 PR 合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0e96d315561972e",
      "translationZh": "你已经在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime 上发布了一个 AI 智能体。它通过受 OAuth 保护的 MCP 服务器调用工具。现在，你希望 CI 能在代码变更进入生产环境之前，告诉你该变更是否导致智能体性能下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9a4615c18006fa5",
      "translationZh": "本文将逐步介绍一条 GitHub Actions 流水线，它将智能体部署到 AgentCore runtime，并通过 AgentCore Evaluate API 使用评估提示词对智能体进行评估。如果智能体表现退化，PR 检查就会失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33b05982715ad45a",
      "translationZh": "我们将涵盖整个技术栈：连接到具有基于角色的访问控制的 MCP 服务器的 Strands 智能体、同时支持机器对机器（M2M）和用户范围授权流程的共享 Cognito 池、CDK 基础设施即代码，以及统一的评估脚本。完整的参考实现可在配套代码仓库中获取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08412aeba2a24a34",
      "translationZh": "使用 CDK 将智能体和 MCP 服务器部署到 AgentCore runtime。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dcab6ddd468ea5b9",
      "translationZh": "对 MCP 工具实施基于角色的访问控制（三层认证授权模式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84929b4be6a55d46",
      "translationZh": "从 CI 调用受 OAuth 保护的运行时（M2M client_credentials 流程）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc3e675fed990abc",
      "translationZh": "使用内置评估器运行按需评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59e538f8e878a2ac",
      "translationZh": "实施质量门禁，在出现回归时阻止合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65eb26e16998abc2",
      "translationZh": "应对 OAuth 挑战：CI 流水线如何在没有用户上下文的情况下进行身份验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b5bf8dbc80d4a2f",
      "translationZh": "在深入探讨之前，先快速介绍一下这些基础组件。如果你已经熟悉它们，可以跳过这一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "588978ad5fe13a16",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore runtime 是一个用于 AI 智能体的托管平台。你部署智能体代码（Python，可使用任意框架），AgentCore 则负责扩缩容、会话隔离和基础设施。可以把它理解为面向智能体的 AWS Lambda。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "362b2d22447af267",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Evaluations 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能，它使用大语言模型（LLM）作为评判者，对智能体行为进行评分。它从 Amazon CloudWatch 读取 OpenTelemetry 追踪数据，并从帮助程度、正确性和工具选择准确性等维度对响应进行评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c1362aa7f156410",
      "translationZh": "MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议）是一种开放协议，智能体通过它提供的标准化接口调用外部工具。MCP 服务器提供工具，智能体发现并调用这些工具。AgentCore runtime 可以托管 MCP 服务器，并将智能体连接到这些服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d41354c35402c6a2",
      "translationZh": "OpenID Connect（OIDC）联合身份认证使 GitHub Actions 无需存储长期凭证即可代入 AWS Identity and Access Management（AWS IAM）角色。GitHub 签发一个短期令牌，AWS 对其进行验证，然后工作流获得临时凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a748f9954d5d25e3",
      "translationZh": "Quality Gate（质量门禁）是一种 CI/CD 模式：流水线中的某个步骤必须达到阈值，构建才能继续。在我们的场景中，智能体的评估分数必须达到最低标准（例如，满分 1.0 时至少达到 0.8），否则 PR 将继续被阻止。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53d049065e591992",
      "translationZh": "这为何重要：如果没有自动化评估，智能体的质量就只能靠主观判断。开发者修改了系统提示词，智能体开始给出更差的回答，却没有人察觉，直到用户开始抱怨。质量门禁能在 PR 阶段发现这种问题，避免其进入生产环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac6ad8320f3d8938",
      "translationZh": "场景是这样的：你有一个部署在 AgentCore runtime 上的智能体。它通过 MCP 服务器调用工具，其中一些工具是公开的，另一些则根据用户角色限制访问。每当有人修改系统提示词、更换模型或更新工具配置时，你都想知道：智能体变得更好了，还是更差了？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aea8174a4729de03",
      "translationZh": "手动测试无法规模化。你需要在 CI 中进行自动化评估。这意味着自动将智能体部署到开发环境，用具有代表性的提示词调用它，对响应进行评分，并在质量下降时阻止合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4946a4abe4a48870",
      "translationZh": "难点在于：你的 MCP 服务器使用 OAuth，并实施基于角色的访问控制。CI 流水线没有用户上下文。面对一个受 OAuth 保护、会将令牌转发给需要用户角色信息的 MCP 服务器的智能体，你该如何让无界面的流水线通过身份验证？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b2c401408361e22c",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Evaluations：它处于什么位置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14710dbe796d0efd",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Evaluations 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 平台中的质量衡量层。它与托管智能体的 AgentCore runtime，以及捕获追踪数据的 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 功能 AgentCore Observability 并列，共同补全了构建 → 部署 → 观测 → 评估的生命周期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b0a7e3518e7d6e1",
      "translationZh": "该服务默认使用 LLM-as-a-judge 为智能体交互评分，也支持通过 AWS Lambda 进行基于代码的评估。它基于 OpenTelemetry 追踪数据运行，这些数据正是你的智能体已通过 AgentCore Observability 发出的追踪数据。对于按需评估，你直接在 API 调用中提供 span 数据；在线评估和批量评估则从 CloudWatch 读取数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4f10514dae341a1",
      "translationZh": "三种评估模式覆盖不同阶段：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5da33545bca857d3",
      "translationZh": "按需评估可随时评估指定会话。你提供跨度数据，选择评估器，即可获得评分。这正是 CI/CD 质量门禁的支撑机制，也是本文的重点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "905b361fda60fbf1",
      "translationZh": "在线评估以可配置的采样率持续监控生产流量。结果会送入 CloudWatch 仪表板，用于趋势监控。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae8fab5710d972e8",
      "translationZh": "批量评估在单个异步作业中为多个会话评分。你将其指向自己的 CloudWatch Logs，选择评估器，即可获得汇总结果和逐会话结果。这正是基线测量以及变更前后回归测试的支撑机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0649470f06c2060c",
      "translationZh": "评估器分为四类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6074b77dc3399ef",
      "translationZh": "内置评估器涵盖常见的质量维度：Helpfulness、Correctness、GoalSuccessRate、ToolSelectionAccuracy、ToolParameterAccuracy 等。它们在会话、追踪和工具调用层级运行。三个轨迹评估器（TrajectoryExactOrderMatch、TrajectoryInOrderMatch、TrajectoryAnyOrderMatch）将实际工具调用序列与预期轨迹进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51303f72392250cb",
      "translationZh": "自定义评估器使用你自己的 LLM-as-a-judge 提示词，进行特定领域的评分。真实参考值字段（expectedResponse、assertions、expectedTrajectory）也可作为占位符用于自定义评估器提示词中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee4e2a1b88ecebbb",
      "translationZh": "基于代码的评估器针对每条追踪或每个会话运行一个 Lambda 函数，并返回由你的自定义实现计算出的评分、标签和解释。可将其用于正则表达式匹配、模式验证或关键词存在性检查等确定性检查，而不产生 LLM 成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7975b8849596280",
      "translationZh": "来自 DeepEval 和 AutoEval 开源库的第三方评估器，由该服务像内置评估器一样进行管理。按 ID 选择一个即可，无需模型或配置。你还可以从内置评估器或第三方评估器派生出自定义评估器，以便在你自己的模型上运行其逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ed9b64d02d7394b",
      "translationZh": "Evaluate API 接受 sessionSpans（来自 CloudWatch 的 OpenTelemetry 追踪数据），并返回结构化评分。每次 evaluate() 调用只能包含来自单个会话的 span。混用不同会话会导致 ValidationException。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "667fd4c43dd3cb27",
      "translationZh": "该 API 还通过 evaluationReferenceInputs 接受可选的真实参考数据。你可以提供 expectedResponse（供 Correctness 使用）、assertions（供 GoalSuccessRate 使用），或 expectedTrajectory（供轨迹评估器使用）。没有真实参考数据的追踪会回退到无需真实参考数据的评估方式，因此你只需为关注的交互轮次提供这些数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a78b55503d558ef",
      "translationZh": "该流水线在共享的 Cognito 用户池后端部署两个 AgentCore 运行时：一个用于 Strands 智能体，另一个用于 MCP 服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "146d07799737a9b1",
      "translationZh": "架构图展示了位于共享 Amazon Cognito 用户池后端、运行在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 上的 Strands 智能体运行时和 MCP 服务器运行时，以及调用智能体并评估追踪数据的 GitHub Actions 流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f5584e7b7a5ccff",
      "translationZh": "单个 Cognito 用户池支持两种身份验证流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5b6f826959edeeb",
      "translationZh": "所有工具（不进行角色检查）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6e1848ac448402d",
      "translationZh": "强制实施基于角色的工具访问限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05863b08a91643b9",
      "translationZh": "GitHub Actions 流水线将智能体技术栈部署到开发环境，从已配置的 Cognito 实例获取 JWT 令牌以验证 API 调用，使用评估数据集调用智能体，并分析 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 中生成的追踪数据，以依据预设阈值评估性能。它会根据总体评分是否满足验收标准，自动批准或阻止 PR。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2934f71aa2a81316",
      "translationZh": "在 CI 中处理受 OAuth 保护的 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4f511f3f5a14f4",
      "translationZh": "当你的智能体调用受 OAuth 保护的 MCP 服务器时，CI 流水线会面临一个挑战：它们没有用户上下文。MCP 服务器要求提供带有角色声明的 JWT，但无界面的 CI 运行器无法完成交互式 OAuth 授权同意流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af3f7af5ea4835fb",
      "translationZh": "评估智能体有三种方法，各有不同的权衡：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28c1fb990609be62",
      "translationZh": "方法 A：评估已存储的追踪记录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46d719bea5d4d4b4",
      "translationZh": "将评估与实时 MCP 调用完全解耦。预发布流水线使用有代表性的提示词运行智能体，捕获追踪记录，并将其作为 JSON 测试数据提交。在 PR 阶段，CI 会评估这些已存储的追踪记录。无需实时调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a64e4ac0ca6d01e",
      "translationZh": "Evaluate API 不需要实时运行的智能体。它会对你提供的 OpenTelemetry span 进行评分。你的 CI 流水线会变得具有确定性（检查已有的追踪记录），同时你也能完全绕开 OAuth 问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46dc3693cc4774d7",
      "translationZh": "权衡：你评估的是预发布部署的行为，而不是当前 PR 中的代码。配套代码仓库包含 scripts/evaluate_stored_traces.py，以及 fixtures/ 中的示例测试数据，可帮助你开始采用这种方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96d14b9a3ab45e0a",
      "translationZh": "方法 B：使用已预先获得授权同意的服务账号",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90184e3066cf731d",
      "translationZh": "在你的身份提供商中创建一个专用测试用户。以交互方式完成一次 OAuth 同意流程，并将刷新令牌缓存到 AWS Secrets Manager 中。CI 使用此令牌以该测试用户的身份调用智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a79cfbff02245290",
      "translationZh": "权衡：刷新令牌会过期。你需要一种轮换机制，或定期手动重新授权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "beba842a6ac3c0cf",
      "translationZh": "方案 C：M2M 身份验证（本文采用的方案）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e771ccd07d64f03",
      "translationZh": "配置你的 MCP 服务器，使其同时支持 M2M 和用户范围的授权类型。CI 使用 M2M 令牌，而交互式用户则走标准的 OAuth 同意流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0c2ae7d2250359b",
      "translationZh": "MCP 服务器中间件会区分令牌类型：M2M 令牌包含权限范围，但不包含角色，因此会绕过角色检查，所有工具均可访问。用户令牌携带 custom:roles 声明，因此会强制实施工具级访问控制。这种绕过方式是安全的，因为 M2M 令牌需要一个从不向最终用户暴露的客户端密钥。只有 CI 流水线和智能体运行时才能获取这些令牌，从而防止不受信任的调用方获得不含角色的令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbc6e44abfb8cc80",
      "translationZh": "权衡：M2M 令牌在设计上会绕过角色检查。如果你需要 CI 专门测试角色权限的强制执行，请使用方案 B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "535216bac4970480",
      "translationZh": "使用下面的决策树，了解哪种方案适合你的用例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "762d9ecad5b2c6ff",
      "translationZh": "根据是否需要实时调用、MCP 服务器兼容性以及角色测试，在评估方案 A、B 和 C 之间进行选择的决策树",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fd7977a02836c70",
      "translationZh": "需要支持双令牌身份验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "322931a558bf170d",
      "translationZh": "提示：先采用方案 A，快速让质量门禁运行起来。再升级到方案 C（本文介绍的方案），实现完整的端到端 CI，对实际 PR 中的代码变更进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c29cd168f976e0d7",
      "translationZh": "拥有 AgentCore 访问权限且已完成 CDK 引导初始化的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fa524c69992a529",
      "translationZh": "已安装并运行 Docker。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7d92d3b515cac38",
      "translationZh": "安装所需的 Python 包：pip install boto3 requests bedrock-agentcore-starter-toolkit",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e575d1ed58203964",
      "translationZh": "注意：bedrock-agentcore-starter-toolkit 中的 Evaluation 类会自动处理从 CloudWatch 收集追踪数据以及评分的工作，因此你无需手动查询日志组或调用底层 Evaluate API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c5424ae141408b20",
      "translationZh": "MCP 服务器：三层身份验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c5d34c85fcf412",
      "translationZh": "对于方案 C，MCP 服务器使用三个层次来同时支持 M2M 令牌和用户范围令牌。这是让 CI 评估与生产环境中的角色权限强制执行协同工作的关键模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5ffb374786495eb",
      "translationZh": "第 1 层 JWT 验证（AgentCore）：平台会在请求到达你的代码之前验证签名、签发者、受众和过期时间。无需自行实现。AgentCore 通过 Custom JWT Authorizer 处理这些验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ff8b8c0b1a0d0a1",
      "translationZh": "第 2 层请求头透传：在两个运行时上都设置 request_header_allowlist=[\"Authorization\"]，以确保 JWT 能够到达智能体和 MCP 容器。AgentCore 会将调用方的 Authorization 请求头原样转发到你的容器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a639f6d808762c12",
      "translationZh": "第 3 层基于角色的工具访问（AuthMiddleware）：这是一个 FastMCP 原生中间件，通过 fastmcp.server.dependencies.get_http_headers() 读取 JWT，使用 PyJWT 解码声明，并根据工具的 meta 对 custom:roles 进行强制校验。M2M 令牌（有作用域但没有角色）拥有完全访问权限。用户令牌则需要具备相应角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ddcee6e4a050867",
      "translationZh": "该中间件直接添加到 FastMCP 服务器实例中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2e455c96bd4e7974",
      "translationZh": "基础设施：CDK 堆栈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36c4cbf5f4032937",
      "translationZh": "CDK 堆栈通过一条命令部署所有内容：Cognito 池、两个运行时、IAM 角色以及预先创建的测试用户。完整实现请参见 infrastructure/stack.py。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59b63a97985f2234",
      "translationZh": "该堆栈创建的关键资源包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a44cd5775654ec59",
      "translationZh": "一个用于 CI 的 M2M 应用客户端（client_credentials 流程）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2946bc76b185c0b",
      "translationZh": "一个用于交互式使用的用户应用客户端（authorization_code 流程）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f72ba11f469b608b",
      "translationZh": "两个预先创建的用户：user-a（FinanceUser）和 user-b（HRUser）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "238a9afb52222eb0",
      "translationZh": "一个配备 JWT 授权器的 MCP 服务器 AgentCore 运行时（协议：MCP）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3afae32de4b5122c",
      "translationZh": "一个配备 JWT 授权器的 Strands 智能体 AgentCore 运行时（协议：HTTP）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c52b61478fa3512",
      "translationZh": "GitHub Actions 工作流在开发环境中部署 CDK 堆栈，并使用创建的资源运行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef49e734f090e744",
      "translationZh": "统一评估脚本（scripts/agentcore_eval.py）处理完整流水线：获取令牌、等待运行时就绪、调用智能体、等待追踪记录、运行评估，并根据阈值决定是否放行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f9d0c276b58ce3a",
      "translationZh": "令牌获取使用标准的 client_credentials 授权方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "414fac705c2d46ff",
      "translationZh": "智能体调用使用 HTTPS 和 Bearer token（而非 boto3）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aa52a38244a8dea",
      "translationZh": "该脚本使用 bedrock-agentcore-starter-toolkit 的 Evaluation 类来运行评估，该类会自动处理从 CloudWatch 收集跟踪数据的工作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c4d60381d0b025c",
      "translationZh": "评估提示词覆盖智能体的全部工具范围，包括内置工具、公共 MCP 工具以及按角色限制访问的 MCP 工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e360623718f2c68",
      "translationZh": "GitHub Actions 工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e062987148d0a5f",
      "translationZh": "每当提交到 main 的 PR 涉及智能体代码、MCP 服务器、基础设施或脚本时，该工作流都会运行。它会部署 CDK 堆栈、调用智能体、运行评估、以 PR 评论的形式发布结果，并拆除堆栈。完整实现请参阅完整工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51a5d600d8477b61",
      "translationZh": "关键步骤如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b9ba69d91277ddd",
      "translationZh": "警告：CDK 部署返回后，运行时仍会在 CREATING 状态停留几分钟，在其进入 READY 状态之前调用它会失败，并返回 424 Failed Dependency。工作流会轮询 get_agent_runtime（通过 bedrock-agentcore-control 客户端），直到两者都处于 READY 状态，然后在评估前预热 MCP 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a4b59c220ccd9bc",
      "translationZh": "配置以下组件，以在你的 CI/CD 流水线中启用自动化智能体评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a09328f034853f1a",
      "translationZh": "1. 创建 GitHub OIDC 提供程序（仅需一次）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7a7b441ccc21d90d",
      "translationZh": "2. 为 GitHub Actions 创建 IAM 角色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84d797e50368e263",
      "translationZh": "创建一个角色，为你的仓库配置信任策略，并授予 CDK、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore、Amazon Cognito、Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 和 Amazon Bedrock 的相关权限。完整策略请参阅配套仓库的 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6d9471ae619204d3",
      "translationZh": "3. 添加 GitHub 密钥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf250f52280e8db9",
      "translationZh": "上述 IAM 角色的 ARN",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "562c132054870cfb",
      "translationZh": "其余所有信息均在运行时从 CDK 输出中读取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4dc9bfe1a789cca",
      "translationZh": "内置评估器参考",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33762272d832766e",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 提供多种内置评估器，按评估对象分类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d614d55a35514ee8",
      "translationZh": "对话是否实现了用户的目标？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1f2931fb07f1b3e",
      "translationZh": "有用性、正确性、连贯性、简洁性、忠实性、指令遵循、回答相关性、上下文相关性、有害性、拒绝回答、刻板印象",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f427098335ffa635",
      "translationZh": "每次请求的质量与安全性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d50cfe81ee0552b9",
      "translationZh": "工具选择准确率、工具参数准确率、轨迹精确顺序匹配、轨迹顺序匹配、轨迹任意顺序匹配、技能选择准确率、技能指令遵循",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ba8277cd3770dae",
      "translationZh": "是否使用正确的参数调用了正确的工具？轨迹评估器检查工具调用顺序（需要 expectedTrajectory 作为真实基准）。技能评估器检查技能选择和指令遵循情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8aaca3899a87a47",
      "translationZh": "本文使用四个评估器：GoalSuccessRate、Correctness、ToolSelectionAccuracy 和 ToolParameterAccuracy。工具调用评估器尤其适用于使用 MCP 工具的智能体。它们会验证智能体是否选择了正确的工具，并传入了正确的参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0836c1a35bd147cc",
      "translationZh": "提示：在 CI 中，先从四到五个评估器开始。为调用工具的智能体添加轨迹评估器，为面向客户的智能体添加安全评估器（Harmfulness、Stereotyping、Refusal）。使用基于代码的评估器进行确定性检查。使用全套定期深度评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "660317bdafab4731",
      "translationZh": "测试流水线：失败、修复、通过",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9733c44be37230e",
      "translationZh": "要建立对质量门禁的信心，一个可靠的方法是观察它捕获一次真实的回归问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73fb6b4c0fc4dcc",
      "translationZh": "故意制造失败：将智能体的系统提示词改成无助于完成任务的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ff45e1b302cdec",
      "translationZh": "推送到功能分支并创建一个 PR。流水线运行后，你会看到：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1b66fee2816ec75",
      "translationZh": "注意：ToolSelectionAccuracy 仍有可能通过，因为即使系统提示词很差，智能体也可能选择正确的工具。各评估器会独立衡量不同维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26a8310bc787fe6a",
      "translationZh": "修复并通过：恢复合适的系统提示词，再次推送。流水线会重新运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c75ee94b98b261ee",
      "translationZh": "警告：LLM-as-judge 评分存在固有波动。因此，同一个提示词评估两次，可能得到略有不同的分数。设置阈值时，应使其略低于你的目标可靠性水平，留出一定余量，以应对这种波动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "005be1a5a7facf67",
      "translationZh": "我们端到端地运行了这条流水线。以下是容易踩的坑，帮你省下调试时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "963c97fd1adce889",
      "translationZh": "要调用受 OAuth 保护的 AgentCore 运行时，请使用 Bearer 令牌直接向 HTTPS 端点发送 POST 请求，而不是使用 boto3 中的 invoke_agent_runtime() 方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7189156ec33064ff",
      "translationZh": "追踪数据传播需要 30-90 秒。评估脚本每隔 30 秒重试一次，最长持续 10 分钟。不要在调用后立即查询 CloudWatch。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3385d9586a0d0d44",
      "translationZh": "必须使用 ARM64 镜像。AgentCore 运行时要求使用 ARM64 容器。GitHub 运行器采用 x86_64 架构。因此，请使用 QEMU + Docker Buildx 进行交叉编译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28181cb771b9cfe0",
      "translationZh": "CDK 部署后运行时会重启。在运行时进入 READY 状态之前调用它，会失败并返回 424 Failed Dependency，因此，工作流会轮询 get_agent_runtime，直到两个运行时都就绪（并预热 MCP 服务器），然后再发起调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8613337d4786fe32",
      "translationZh": "sessionSpans 是 API 参数名。Evaluate API 接受 evaluationInput: \"sessionSpans\": [...] 。每次调用只能包含来自同一个会话的跨度数据。混合多个会话的数据会导致 ValidationException。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a435dd9cf9429fb",
      "translationZh": "时间戳必须是整数。startTimeUnixNano 等 OpenTelemetry 纳秒时间戳必须是 JSON 整数，不能是带引号的字符串。字符串时间戳会导致 ValidationException。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca2b20c075688091",
      "translationZh": "适配 Microsoft Entra ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e60620baaa99dde",
      "translationZh": "本文使用 Amazon Cognito，但该架构不依赖特定的身份提供商。如果你的组织使用 Microsoft Entra ID（原名 Azure AD），只需进行有针对性的修改，同一套流水线就能正常工作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d44e0041f4f7018e",
      "translationZh": "令牌端点：将 Amazon Cognito 的区域端点改为 https://login.microsoftonline.com/tenant_id/oauth2/v2.0/token 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "faa8d08ef44357d7",
      "translationZh": "发现 URL：改为 https://login.microsoftonline.com/tenant_id/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97434d7c2568bd7e",
      "translationZh": "客户端凭据：将 Cognito 客户端 ID 和受众替换为 Entra ID 应用程序 ID 和作用域 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89b716ef532a00c4",
      "translationZh": "其他一切保持不变。部署脚本的 authorizerConfiguration.customJWTAuthorizer 结构完全相同，评估脚本不涉及身份验证（它通过 boto3 使用 IAM），GitHub Actions 工作流结构也不变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bdd9e490aa5421fa",
      "translationZh": "权衡与局限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f0951979090e1ac",
      "translationZh": "流水线耗时约 10 分钟。包括 CDK 部署 + 运行时启动 + 跟踪传播 + 评估。用于 PR 门禁没问题，但对于提交前检查来说太慢。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a480e17d2f0052cc",
      "translationZh": "LLM-as-judge 存在固有的波动性。同一条跟踪记录评估两次，可能会得到略有不同的分数。设置阈值时要留出余量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7bdd716f0c693817",
      "translationZh": "每次运行都有成本。每次调用评估器都会调用裁判模型。4 个评估器 × 5 个提示词 = 每个 PR 调用裁判模型 20 次。大规模使用时要监控 Bedrock 成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7cb49508335a6ff",
      "translationZh": "M2M 令牌会绕过角色检查。按照设计，CI 需要访问所有工具。如果你需要 CI 测试角色权限约束，请使用方案 B（服务账户）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73306f2e2eb55c21",
      "translationZh": "注意：尽管存在这些局限，自动化评估仍然严格优于完全不做评估。即使质量门禁并不完善，也能发现人工审查遗漏的明显退化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc7600d5702b471e",
      "translationZh": "配套仓库会配置两个 AgentCore 运行时、一个 Cognito 用户池、IAM 角色以及预先创建的用户，因此完成后请销毁所有资源，以免继续产生费用。只需一条命令即可全部移除：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6db5577b32624e4",
      "translationZh": "如果你使用 npx 而不是全局 CDK CLI 进行部署，请改为运行 npx aws-cdk@2 destroy --force。在开发栈中，cdk destroy 会移除两个运行时、Cognito 用户池及其应用客户端、预先创建的用户、IAM 角色，以及 AWS Secrets Manager 中的 M2M 客户端密钥。该密钥的移除策略设置为 destroy，因此反复部署和销毁也不会留下残余资源。CI 工作流会在每次运行结束时自动销毁同一个栈，因为其 CDK 销毁步骤使用 if: always() 运行。只有在跟随本文操作、自行部署栈时，你才需要使用这条命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "349354d4d5be1e98",
      "translationZh": "三层 MCP 身份验证（从平台 JWT 验证，到中间件声明提取，再到工具级角色检查）清晰地分离了各层职责，无需修改代码即可同时支持 M2M 流程和用户作用域流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c9b72dd7ec4edd3",
      "translationZh": "CDK 部署所有资源。一条 cdk deploy 即可创建 Cognito 用户池、两个运行时、IAM 角色以及预先创建的用户。一条 cdk destroy 即可将它们全部销毁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e00162b9d42cd4f8",
      "translationZh": "bedrock-agentcore-starter-toolkit 简化了评估。Evaluation 类负责从 CloudWatch 收集追踪数据并进行评分，因此无需手动查询日志组，也无需使用 sessionSpans 调用底层 Evaluate API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd7a07033587044c",
      "translationZh": "令牌转发衔接了 CI 与生产环境。智能体检查传入的 JWT，以判断它是用户令牌（转发给 MCP 进行角色检查）还是 M2M 令牌（使用共享客户端，跳过角色检查）。同一套代码为两类调用方提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1d6fd6eee7c56d3b",
      "translationZh": "Evaluate API 与智能体运行时解耦。评估追踪数据不需要正在运行的智能体。这是让方案 A（已存储的追踪数据）得以奏效的关键洞见，也是一条直接通向 CI 质量门禁的路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84a205129900ec3c",
      "translationZh": "从四个评估器入手，再逐步扩展。GoalSuccessRate、Correctness、ToolSelectionAccuracy 和 ToolParameterAccuracy 涵盖了基本需求。为面向客户的智能体添加安全评估器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "107a03c694e1ca0b",
      "translationZh": "标准答案和基于代码的评估器进一步扩充了工具集。轨迹评估器以程序化方式运行，不收取额外费用，非常适合 CI。基于代码的评估器会在同一次评估调用中执行确定性的 Lambda 检查，同时进行 LLM-as-judge 评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d2c5bfe88d5d9cf",
      "translationZh": "配套代码仓库包含完整实现：用于 Cognito 和两个运行时的 CDK 基础设施、具有 MCP 客户端和令牌转发功能的智能体、具有基于角色的访问控制功能的 MCP 服务器、统一的评估脚本、GitHub Actions 工作流，以及两个操作演示脚本。使用 scripts/deploy_and_test_rbac.py 进行部署和基于角色的访问测试，使用 scripts/evaluation_pipeline.py 运行评估流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ca9b1dbc7a9d6f1",
      "translationZh": "要扩展该项目，你可以先采用方案 A，针对随附的测试夹具运行 python3 scripts/evaluate_stored_traces.py，无需进行任何部署。接下来，可以尝试向 MCP 服务器添加一个新的受角色权限限制的工具（参见 mcp-server/README.md），或使用你自己的 LLM-as-judge 提示词创建自定义评估器。也可以尝试按环境调整 EVAL_THRESHOLD（例如，开发环境设为 0.7，预发布环境设为 0.8，生产环境设为 0.9）。你还可以设置在线评估，以持续监控生产环境，或根据你的使用场景比较按需评估与在线评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb7f326d2a9163f6",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 开发者指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
